From 8099cc0283b840d7894f5362875c775d70d5d433 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yumi Yukimura <me.cafebabe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 03:52:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] codec2: add RGBA8888 output to software decoders

Advertise and produce RGBA_8888 output from all software video
decoders, including AVC, HEVC, MPEG, VPX, AV1, and APV.

Add shared libyuv conversion helpers for planar 8/10/12-bit and
P210 sources while preserving existing YUV output behavior.

Assisted-by: OpenCode/gpt-5.6-sol
Change-Id: I9b83ee199010ff6b9ccf78c4ef2aa33094d5e126
